| Category | Keybinding | Action |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Navigation** | `Arrow Keys` | Move cursor |
| | `Page Up` / `Page Down` | Scroll page |
| | `Ctrl + G` | Go to line |
| **Editing** | `Ctrl + C` | Copy |
| | `Ctrl + X` | Cut |
| | `Ctrl + V` | Paste |
| | `Ctrl + Z` | Undo |
| | `Ctrl + Y` | Redo |
| **Search** | `Ctrl + F` | Find |
| | `F3` | Find next |
| | `Ctrl + H` | Replace |
| **File** | `Ctrl + S` | Save |
| | `Ctrl + Shift + S` | Save As |
| | `Ctrl + Q` | Quit |

